{"a":[43,43],"h":"<p>43.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"147\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 146.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.7 33.7 40.6 40.6 48.0 48.0 54.7 54.7 70.6 70.6 77.3 89.3 105.0 105.0 115.6 115.6 122.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"77.3 89.3 122.3 130.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve dilersek onları: o zürriyyetleri fülki meşhûn gibi olan rahimlerde, kendilerini de onun mislinden bindikleri gemilerde gark ediveririz <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 134.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.7 50.3 62.3 69.0 69.0 76.6 99.0 111.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 50.3 76.6 104.3 111.0 117.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> de ne o zürriyyetler için bir feryadcı, bir feryad eden veya feryada yetişen bulunur<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"137\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 137.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 44.2 51.0 51.0 57.7 57.7 73.4 73.4 82.4 82.4 100.4 112.4\" y=\"26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 44.2 105.0 112.4 120.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ne de berikiler gark oldukları denizden kurtarılırlar. 44. </p>"}